<p dir=3D"auto">If no <code>content</code> is supplied, Mimic automatically=
 captures the current page by moving its existing body content into an inte=
rnal wrapper. It preserves important styling such as the background, text c=
olour, fonts, font size, and line height before injecting the website into =
the fake browser.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">Because the website is <strong>moved into the fake browser =
rather than embedded in another browsing context</strong>, it remains the r=
eal top-level page.</p>
<p dir=3D"auto">This means traditional iframe-based framebusting checks suc=
h as:</p>
